Express      → Backend framework for creating APIs.
MongoDB      → NoSQL database for storing data.
Mongoose     → ODM to interact with MongoDB.

              Object Document Mapper(An ODM is a tool that helps your application interact with a document database like
                                    MongoDB using objects instead of writing raw database queries. In MERN, Mongoose is the ODM.)


React        → Frontend library for building UI.
Node.js      → JavaScript runtime for server-side code.
JWT          → Authentication token.
bcryptjs     → Password hashing library.
Axios        → API request library.
CORS         → Allows cross-origin requests.
Dotenv       → Manages environment variables.
Nodemon      → Auto-restarts server during development.
